  "description": "Smart turn detection for the Voxa pipeline (P0 latency). Plugs an ISmartTurnClassifier into the VAD's silence timeout so a within-sentence pause doesn't end the turn early — letting StopDuration drop without clipping speech. Ships an HTTP classifier; the on-device ONNX classifier is the documented next step.",
